# Auto-requests review; it gates nothing until "Require review from Code Owners"
# is enabled on the main ruleset.
*                         @gurre

# The paths that decide what runs in CI, what the local gate checks, which
# dependencies enter the build, and who reviews all of that. Listed explicitly
# so a narrower `*` owner added later cannot approve changes to them.
/.github/CODEOWNERS       @gurre
/.github/workflows/       @gurre
/.github/dependabot.yml   @gurre
/.githooks/               @gurre
/go.mod                   @gurre
/go.sum                   @gurre
/SECURITY.md              @gurre
